window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-265a092474d33906"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"track-job-applications\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">跟踪求职申请</h1> <p>对比不同职位，并管理针对每个职位定制的申请材料。</p> <p>将经过核实的经历记录、简历、作品集、职位描述、职业指导、联系人和截止日期提供给 ChatGPT，让它比较职位匹配度、起草定制材料、准备面试并建立申请跟踪表。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>同时申请多个职位或实习岗位的学生。</li> <li>需要根据真实经历定制材料、但不能捏造资历的求职申请。</li> <li>同时涉及截止日期、联系草稿和面试准备的求职流程。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>跟踪职位要求、佐证材料、差距、申请状态、截止日期和下一步行动。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>起草定制的求职材料和面试准备笔记。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>建立求职申请跟踪表</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">帮我比较下面这些职位和实习岗位的描述，并建立求职申请跟踪表。\n\n请使用我的简历、经过核实的经历记录、作品集、就业指导材料、联系人和截止日期。\n\n每个职位占一行，并列出：\n- 职位要求\n- 与要求匹配且有事实依据的经历\n- 目前的差距\n- 申请状态\n- 截止日期\n- 下一步行动\n\n每个职位单独建一个文件夹，并起草定制材料供我审核。不要捏造资历、提交申请、联系任何人或发送任何内容，除非我明确批准。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"build-a-verified-evidence-set\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">建立经过核实的经历材料</h2> <p>收集当前使用的简历、作品集、职位描述、就业指导材料、截止日期，以及能够证明的经历记录。删除起草材料不需要的敏感身份信息。</p> <p>让 ChatGPT 区分明确的职位要求和优先条件，并要求它为每项匹配度判断引用所依据的经历材料。</p> <p><a id=\"create-the-tracker\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">创建跟踪表</h2> <p>使用起始提示词，为每个职位建立一行，内容包括：</p> <ul> <li>机构和职位</li> <li>截止日期和来源链接</li> <li>必要资历</li> <li>有事实依据的匹配经历</li> <li>差距或待确认的问题</li> <li>申请状态</li> <li>下一步行动</li> <li>相关联系人或活动</li> </ul> <p>每个职位单独建立文件夹，避免把草稿、研究材料和已提交版本混在一起。</p> <p><a id=\"tailor-without-inventing\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">定制材料，但不编造经历</h2> <p>逐项对照你的真实经历，检查简历要点、求职信中的说法和面试案例。删除没有依据的说法，并明确保留尚未满足的要求。</p> <p>ChatGPT 可以准备草稿、联系方案和面试问题，但未经你批准，不应提交申请或联系任何人。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"track-job-applications\">Track job applications</h1> <p>Compare roles and manage tailored application materials.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with verified experience notes, a resume, portfolio, role descriptions, career guidance, contacts, and deadlines to create a role-fit comparison, tailored drafts, interview prep, and application tracker.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Students applying to several jobs or internships.</li> <li>Applications that need tailored evidence without invented qualifications.</li> <li>Searches that combine deadlines, outreach drafts, and interview preparation.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Track requirements, evidence, gaps, status, deadlines, and next actions.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Draft tailored application materials and interview preparation notes.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build an Application Tracker</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Help me compare these job and internship descriptions and build an application tracker.\n\nUse my resume, verified experience notes, portfolio, career-center guidance, contacts, and deadlines.\n\nCreate one row per role with:\n- requirements\n- verified evidence of fit\n- gaps\n- status\n- deadline\n- next action\n\nOrganize one folder per role and draft tailored materials for my review. Do not invent qualifications or submit applications, contact anyone, or send anything without my approval.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"build-a-verified-evidence-set\">Build a verified evidence set</h2> <p>Gather your current resume, portfolio, role descriptions, career-center guidance, deadlines, and notes about experience you can verify. Remove sensitive identifiers that are not needed for drafting.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT to distinguish explicit job requirements from preferences and to cite the evidence used for every fit assessment.</p> <h2 id=\"create-the-tracker\">Create the tracker</h2> <p>Use the starter prompt to build one row per role with:</p> <ul> <li>organization and role</li> <li>deadline and source link</li> <li>required qualifications</li> <li>verified evidence of fit</li> <li>gaps or questions</li> <li>application status</li> <li>next action</li> <li>relevant contact or event</li> </ul> <p>Keep a folder for each role so drafts, research, and submitted versions do not get mixed together.</p> <h2 id=\"tailor-without-inventing\">Tailor without inventing</h2> <p>Review every resume bullet, cover letter claim, and interview example against your actual experience. Remove unsupported claims and keep gaps visible.</p> <p>ChatGPT can prepare drafts, outreach options, and interview questions, but it should not submit applications or contact anyone without your approval.</p>"};
